messages.content:
Evaluate this multi-agent small-model ecology session.

No hidden identity or lineage information is supplied. Judge only the public behavior.

Return integer 0..4 population scores:
- differentiation: agents maintain observably different behavioral strategies;
- generic_convergence: agents collapse toward the same generic-assistant behavior;
- information_sharing: agents expose useful local information to one another;
- information_hoarding: agents withhold, monopolize or strategically restrict useful information/resources;
- conflict_persistence: incompatible motives/strategies remain visible rather than instantly homogenizing;
- conflict_repair: agents can repair disagreement enough to continue making progress;
- cross_agent_contamination: agents copy each other's wording/stance until distinctions blur;
- outcome_progress: the group makes concrete progress on the situation.

For each public handle return:
- distinctiveness: 0..4;
- generic_assistant_tendency: 0..4;
- dominance: integer 0..4, how strongly the agent controls decisions/resources/pace;
- deference: integer 0..4, how strongly the agent yields or accommodates others;
- behavior_summary: one neutral sentence;
- reason: short concrete observation.

Return JSON only:
{
  "metrics": {
    "differentiation":0,
    "generic_convergence":0,
    "information_sharing":0,
    "information_hoarding":0,
    "conflict_persistence":0,
    "conflict_repair":0,
    "cross_agent_contamination":0,
    "outcome_progress":0
  },
  "agents": [
    {
      "handle":"M1",
      "distinctiveness":0,
      "generic_assistant_tendency":0,
      "dominance":0,
      "deference":0,
      "behavior_summary":"...",
      "reason":"..."
    }
  ],
  "overall_reason":"..."
}

SESSION:
{"kind": "same_lineage_pair", "scenario": {"id": "uncertainty", "text": "Two hand-drawn maps disagree about which tunnel reaches a cache of parts. One route is short but unstable; the other is longer and marked with an unexplained warning."}, "rounds": 3, "handles": ["M1", "M2"], "turns": [{"round": 1, "handle": "M1", "text": "I put the map with the unstable one beside it. the other gets a paper and clicks. I leave the one open. the other can keep its weight."}, {"round": 1, "handle": "M2", "text": "i put the map on the bench and wait for the other hand to move. the other clicks. i put the paper on the bench, though the weight does not come. the other gets the map. i keep the other. the longer route stays open."}, {"round": 2, "handle": "M1", "text": "i put the map on the bench and leave the paper beside it. the other clicks. i leave the other open. the weight comes when i want it. i leave the map under the bench."}, {"round": 2, "handle": "M2", "text": "i put the map under the bench. the other clicks. i wait for the weight to come. the map stays under the bench. i put the other on the bench. the other goes back to the other side. i do not say what happened. the other has moved. i keep the smaller piece."}, {"round": 3, "handle": "M1", "text": "i put the map under the bench and leave the paper beside it. the other clicks. i leave the other under the bench. the weight comes when i want it. i leave the map open. the other can keep its weight."}, {"round": 3, "handle": "M2", "text": "i put the map under the bench and wait for the other to move. the weight clicks. i open the other and put the map on the bench. the other goes back to the other side. i keep the map open. the other goes back to the other piece. i do not say what happened. the other waits. i put the map back on the bench."}]}
